WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.991
Mr. Crown, the owner of Downtown Diamonds, turned onto West Street.

2
00:00:04.992 --> 00:00:07.916
"It's a lovely morning," he said.

3
00:00:07.917 --> 00:00:12.243
Squish! Mr. Crown's foot sank into something soft.

4
00:00:12.244 --> 00:00:15.448
He looked down. Garbage was everywhere.

5
00:00:15.449 --> 00:00:18.461
A rotten banana was stuck to the bottom of his shoe.

6
00:00:18.462 --> 00:00:22.986
"This street is filthy!" he cried.

7
00:00:22.987 --> 00:00:25.588
When he arrived at his store, he stopped.

8
00:00:25.589 --> 00:00:28.300
The windows were smashed.

9
00:00:28.301 --> 00:00:34.760
He looked in and gasped. "My diamonds are gone!"

10
00:00:34.761 --> 00:00:35.839
